      "side": 1,
      "message": "This `else` block appears to modify `_lastState` prematurely, which seems incorrect.\n\n`_lastState` should represent the state of reviewers *before* the current batch of updates is processed. By modifying it here, if a user is added and then removed within the same batch, they will be treated as if they were already a reviewer.\n\nThis leads to the message \"removed from REVIEWER\", when the more accurate message (from your changes in `_getUpdateMessage`) would be \"was REMOVED\".\n\nWas this `else` block intended to be included? Removing it seems to align better with the overall goal of this change.",
